  "name": "Beef Stroganoff",
  "subtitle": "Tender beef and mushrooms in a tangy cream sauce",
  "description": "A quick skillet meal combining sliced beef, mushrooms, mustard, and crème fraîche with a savory stock-based sauce.",
  "meal_type": "soup",
